{"seq":87,"slug":"modern-prolog-programming","title":"Prolog 与逻辑编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"prolog-与逻辑编程\">Prolog 与逻辑编程</h1><p>Prolog 诞生于 1972 年，由 Alain Colmerauer 和 Robert Kowalski 创造，是将一阶逻辑直接作为编程范式的首次大规模实践。程序员不描述「如何计算」，而是声明「什么为真」——系统通过合一与归结自动推导答案。这种声明式风格使 Prolog 在知识表示、自然语言处理、符号推理和约束求解领域保持独特优势，即使在命令式语言主导的工业环境中也未被替代。</p>\n<p>本 hub 从理论基础出发，经过编程技法，进入高级主题，最终落地到实际应用生态。四个章节构成完整学习路径：「基础」建立合一、归结、搜索的核心概念；「编程技法」掌握列表递归、DCG 语法解析和约束逻辑编程的惯用模式；「高级主题」探讨元编程、tabling 记忆化和并发执行；「应用」覆盖知识表示、SWI-Prolog 工业生态以及 Scryer Prolog、Picat 等现代逻辑编程语言的演进方向。</p>\n<p>前置知识：离散数学中的命题逻辑与谓词逻辑基础、递归思维、基本的数据结构概念。无需事先掌握任何特定编程语言，但有函数式编程经验会降低理解门槛。</p>\n<p>与相邻 hub 的边界划分：functional-programming hub 聚焦 lambda 演算、高阶函数和类型系统，本 hub 聚焦合一、非确定性搜索和逻辑推导；programming-language-design hub 讨论语言设计理论（语法、语义、类型论），本 hub 是一门具体范式的深度实践；knowledge-graphs hub 关注图结构的数据建模与查询（RDF/SPARQL），本 hub 关注基于逻辑规则的符号推理引擎。三者在「声明式编程」这一大伞下各有侧重，读者可按需互补。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：<a href=\"../functional-programming/\">函数式编程</a>、<a href=\"../programming-language-design/\">编程语言设计</a></p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unification-resolution","title":"合一与归结原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/unification-resolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"facts-rules-queries","title":"事实、规则与查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/facts-rules-queries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-strategies-cut","title":"搜索策略与剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/search-strategies-cut"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"programming-techniques","title":"编程技法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"list-processing-recursion","title":"列表处理与递归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/list-processing-recursion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dcg-parsing","title":"DCG 与语法解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/dcg-parsing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constraint-logic-programming","title":"约束逻辑编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/constraint-logic-programming"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-topics","title":"高级主题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/advanced-topics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meta-programming-reflection","title":"元编程与反射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/advanced-topics/meta-programming-reflection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tabling-memoization","title":"Tabling 与记忆化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/advanced-topics/tabling-memoization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrency-parallel-prolog","title":"并发与并行 Prolog","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/advanced-topics/concurrency-parallel-prolog"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"knowledge-representation-ai","title":"知识表示与 AI 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/knowledge-representation-ai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"swi-prolog-ecosystem","title":"SWI-Prolog 生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/swi-prolog-ecosystem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-logic-programming","title":"现代逻辑编程语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/modern-logic-programming"}]}]}